# config/packages — pacman source of truth (Arch-native, v0.1)
# IDEA: declarative package management without NixOS.
# - Add a line -> `luci sync` installs it.
# - Remove a line -> `luci sync --prune` uninstalls it (after confirm).
# - One package per line, `#` = comment. No versions pinned in v0.1 (track Arch Extra).
# - AUR packages live in packages-arch, NOT here.
# - Protected base (kernel, firmware, drivers) lives in protected-packages and is never pruned.

# --- base / boot / firmware (never prune, see protected-packages) ---
base
base-devel
linux
linux-firmware
linux-firmware-amdgpu
amd-ucode
